  "meta": {
    "name": "Ethereum Mainnet RWA: add USDrf and sUSDrf, and switch on their two vaults",
    "description": "Calls 1 to 4 price USDrf and sUSDrf on the RWA router 0x3643E21087B7a6D3128AB4Ba35310ba0E7628504 with RedStone's NAV feeds and add the USDrf vault 0x0F4E2AF3042FdECC3A10707252e8d617DB3B35c3 and the sUSDrf vault 0x0Ee3807A399BFC5F58ed88faEf1a4A40F0EA0601 to it. Calls 5 to 16 let six RWA vaults (eUSDC-69, eUSDT-33, ePAXG-3, ereUSD-1, ereUSDe-1, eUSDS-8; emAPOLLO-1 is left out so nobody can borrow mAPOLLO) lend against USDrf at 93% / 95% and sUSDrf at 90% / 92% (borrow / liquidation). Call 17 lets the USDrf vault lend against sUSDrf at 90% / 92%. Calls 18 and 19 switch the USDrf and sUSDrf vaults on. RealFi has already allowed both vaults to hold its tokens.",
    "txBuilderVersion": "1.18.0",
    "createdFromSafeAddress": "0x4f894Bfc9481110278C356adE1473eBe2127Fd3C",
    "createdFromOwnerAddress": ""
  },
